# The deployable bundle and the contract sources must keep LF endings: the
# first line is the bare `# { "Depends": ... }` comment the network reads, and
# a CRLF checkout has silently broken a GenLayer deploy before. Force LF for
# every text file so a checkout on any OS produces byte-identical sources.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
